# Mission 2 — Fire in the Sky. Combat tutorial.

[level]
arc       = 1
index     = 0
id        = 2
title     = Fire in the Sky
blurb     = First contact with an adversary that moves. Four posts sit between you; whoever holds the middle holds the game.
objective = Eliminate the Simple colonizer. Take the contested middle before it does.
hint      = Both sides start even. Speed into the middle is the whole advantage.
hint      = Twice the ships is roughly four times the power: concentrate, do not trickle.
hint      = A sub being captured stops producing before it flips - starve what you cannot yet take.
enemy     = simple v1
horizon   = 1500


